      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "采集木石矿煤并通过蓝图加工为建筑和装备，持续扩充列车生产与防御能力。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Gather wood, rocks, ores, coal, and then transform them into various resources to create new buildings and equipment using blueprints that you unlock along the way.",
